# Targets to delete from the home directory on `chezmoi apply`.
#
# chezmoi never deletes: a file removed from this repo keeps living in the home
# directory on every machine that already applied it. Listing it here is what
# actually removes it. Entries are paths relative to home, no leading `~/`.
#
# FOOTGUN: never list a path that is still managed here, including a parent
# directory of one. chezmoi aborts the entire apply with `inconsistent state`
# and removes nothing at all, not even the valid entries. That is why the
# skills below are listed one by one instead of as `.claude/skills`, and why
# the agents and hooks are individual files rather than their directories,
# which would break the moment an agent or hook is added back.
#
# Entries are safe to prune once every machine has applied them.

.claude/README.md
.claude/principles.md

.claude/hooks/session-end-cleanup.sh

.claude/agents/architect.md
